id: constraint.loop_safety
category: constraint
status: verified
date: 2026-08-24
content: "Hard limits prevent infinite loops: max_turns=25, max_tokens_total=131072, max_wall_time=600s, repetition_threshold=3."
notes: |
  LoopSafetyMonitor tracks: tool repetition, token usage, wall time, turn count
  Warning at 5 repeated tools, block at 8
  Window size: 20 turns (increased from 10 to reduce false positives)
  Pattern 4 (same-tool-name-3x) removed — replaced with arg-aware logic
  These limits are non-negotiable — they protect the system from runaway execution
tags: [loop-safety, hard-limits, guardrails, reliability]
